ligolo-agent
Usage: ligolo-agent -connect OPERATOR:11601 [-ignore-cert]

The target side of ligolo-ng: dropped on a foothold, it dials back to your
`ligolo-proxy` and becomes the far end of the tunnel, so the foothold's network
shows up as a local interface on your box.

	-connect HOST:11601   dial back to the operator's proxy
	-ignore-cert          accept a self-signed cert (pairs with -selfcert)

For authorised engagements only -- this is code you place on another machine.

See also: ligolo-proxy, chisel
